docs {
  title: Register Missing Fields
  description: |
    Test registration with missing required fields.
    
    This test should fail because:
    - Password is missing (required field)
    
  examples: |
    **Expected Response (400):**
    ```json
    {
      "message": "Email and password are required"
    }
    ```
} 